        Cell["Including both cubic and quartic vertices generates the s-, t- \
and u-channel exchanges and the four-graviton contact. Do not select a single \
channel. The diagram sheet is displayed before CreateFeynAmp or any FORM \
calculation is called.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "6162d8d6-59be-41c6-a914-361541dbb910"], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"treeTopologies", 
